Chapter: WebTheme
  cites UI chapter Theme
  cites WebApp chapter WebRuntime

 Theme-building helpers shared by every browser app. These are the
 short constructors every Page chapter used to define locally: border
 sides, edges, widget styles, and flat state-style sets. An app keeps
 only its palette and CSS text; everything mechanical lives here.

Section: Builders

  bsn : BorderSide = BorderSide { brd-width = 0, brd-color = 0 }
  bn : Border = Border { bdr-top = bsn, bdr-right = bsn, bdr-bottom = bsn, bdr-left = bsn, bdr-corner = CornerSharp }
  ez : Edges = Edges { edge-top = 0, edge-right = 0, edge-bottom = 0, edge-left = 0 }
  bdr : Integer, Integer, CornerStyle -> Border
  bdr (w) (c) (corner) = let s = BorderSide { brd-width = w, brd-color = c } in Border { bdr-top = s, bdr-right = s, bdr-bottom = s, bdr-left = s, bdr-corner = corner }
  eu : Integer -> Edges
  eu (v) = Edges { edge-top = v, edge-right = v, edge-bottom = v, edge-left = v }
  exy : Integer, Integer -> Edges
  exy (x) (y) = Edges { edge-top = y, edge-right = x, edge-bottom = y, edge-left = x }
  ws : Integer, Integer, Border, Edges, Edges -> WidgetStyle
  ws (bg) (fg) (b) (pad) (mar) = WidgetStyle { ws-bg = bg, ws-fg = fg, ws-border = b, ws-padding = pad, ws-margin = mar, ws-min-width = 0, ws-min-height = 0, ws-shadow = shadow-none, ws-gradient = gradient-none, ws-accent-border = accent-border-none }
  ss-flat : WidgetStyle -> StateStyles
  ss-flat (s) = StateStyles { ss-normal = s, ss-hover = s, ss-pressed = s, ss-disabled = s, ss-focused = s }

Section: Injection

 inject-app-style installs the app's Theme and its CSS text into the
 document head. This is the init plumbing every app repeated verbatim;
 the palette and the CSS string are the only per-app inputs.

  inject-app-style : Theme, Text -> Integer
  inject-app-style (th) (css) =
    let t = inject-theme-css th
    in let style = dom-create "style"
    in let s2 = dom-set-text style css
    in let head = dom-query "head"
    in let h2 = dom-append head style
    in 0
